                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Projected Scale of Export and Internal Allocation of
                        Coal for the Three Western Zones of Germany, in Relation to Future Level of
                        Coal Production</hi>
                </head>
                <table cols="4" rows="13">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell cols="4">(Thousands of metric tons)</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Daily Output Ruhr–Aachen plus Saar.</cell>
                        <cell>Percent Allocated to Export.</cell>
                        <cell>Estimated Monthly Export Tonnage.</cell>
                        <cell>Estimated Monthly Internal Tonnage.</cell>
                    </row>
